    "notes": "Single session October 24, 1957 at Capitol Studios (Capitol Tower, post-April-1956). Engineer not documented in available sources. Personnel was the Oscar Peterson quartet throughout (no substitutes). 1997 CD reissue added bonus tracks (tracks 13-21) not included here."
